* Maps

A map maps keys to values.

The zero value of a map is ⟪GTI18N_39107d53_000001⟫nil⟪GTI18N_39107d53_000002⟫.
A ⟪GTI18N_39107d53_000003⟫nil⟪GTI18N_39107d53_000004⟫ map has no keys, nor can keys be added.

The ⟪GTI18N_39107d53_000005⟫make⟪GTI18N_39107d53_000006⟫ function returns a map of the given type,
initialized and ready for use.

